<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Thursday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins steady to 4.00 higher; butts mostly 1.00 higher; skinned hams 17-20 lbs 1.00-2.00 higher, 20-26 lbs steady to 3.00 lower; seedles bellies 12-14 lbs 1.00-2.00 lower; lean trimmings 1.00-3.00 lower. Trading slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings. -- USDA</p>
<p>Note:1 ld of 20-23 lb hams @ 76.00 for immediate delivery.</p>
